<p>In the following discussions, we primarily focus on binary trees.</p>
<h2 id=3D"tree-traversals">Tree Traversals</h2>
<p><strong>Depth-first search (DFS)</strong><br>
<!-- -->DFS is a method for exploring all nodes of a tree by starting at th=
e root and moving as far down a branch as possible, before backtracking to =
explore other branches.</p>
